# Direct dependencies only — used by pip-compile to generate requirements.lock
# Run, ON PYTHON 3.11 to match CI (pip-compile resolves per interpreter — a lock
# built on a newer Python drops 3.11-only transitive deps and pins wheels 3.11
# cannot install, and only CI finds out):
#   python3.11 -m piptools compile --allow-unsafe --generate-hashes requirements.in -o requirements.lock
# Then commit requirements.lock and use in CI with: pip install --require-hashes -r requirements.lock

